/P 79 0 R
/E (It is with great pleasure that I welcome you to the Campus Placement for the Class of 2026 of the School of Law, Justice, and Governance at Gautam Buddha University. This brochure is a testament to the dedication, hard work, and academic excellence of our students, who are now ready to embark on their professional journeys. At the School of Law, Justice, and Governance, we pride ourselves on fostering an environment of intellectual rigor, ethical grounding, and practical skills development. Our comprehensive curriculum, combined with extensive co-curricular and extracurricular activities, ensures that our students are not only well-versed in legal theory but also adept in the practical application of their knowledge. Our students are trained by a distinguished faculty with a wealth of experience and expertise in various fields of law. They benefit from our state-of-the-art infrastructure, including a well-stocked library, advanced research facilities, and access to numerous national and international legal databases.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
122 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
